 Q(none) n=4066           half 0       +0.38 [-0.09, +0.85] p=0.116", "  AGG x mc, Q(none)                  half 0       +0.16 [-0.23, +0.55] p=0.418", "  AGG main, Q(none) n=4130           half 1       -0.24 [-0.72, +0.24] p=0.329", "  AGG x mc, Q(none)                  half 1       -0.32 [-0.72, +0.07] p=0.112", "  AGG slope by mc tercile (secondary)", "  AGG per card in lo-speed tercile, Q(a) all          +0.47 [-0.04, +0.98] p=0.068", "  AGG per card in mid-speed tercile, Q(a) all          -0.05 [-0.59, +0.48] p=0.847", "  AGG per card in hi-speed tercile, Q(a) all          +0.50 [-0.09, +1.08] p=0.096", "  AGG per card in lo-speed tercile, Q(b) all          +0.66 [+0.14, +1.18] p=0.013", "  AGG per card in mid-speed tercile, Q(b) all          +0.09 [-0.46, +0.64] p=0.744", "  AGG per card in hi-speed tercile, Q(b) all          +0.62 [+0.02, +1.22] p=0.042", "\nSensitivity, all formats (11339 decks), format dummy added:", "  mc ends-minus-middle, Q(a), all formats all          +0.00 [-0.31, +0.31] p=0.996", "  mc linear, Q(a), all formats       all          +0.39 [-0.07, +0.85] p=0.094", "  two ends-minus-middle, Q(a), all formats all          -0.12 [-0.43, +0.19] p=0.451", "  two linear, Q(a), all formats      all          -0.15 [-0.60, +0.30] p=0.516", "  AGG x mc, Q(a), all formats        all          -0.09 [-0.34, +0.16] p=0.468", "\n# B8 (b)(c) deck level: enters-tapped lands in clean two-colour decks (Premier, no splash)\n", "Population: 4154 decks, 3376 drafts. Per deck means: PW-on 0.47, SLOW-on 0.07, ALW-on 0.27, off-colour duals 0.01; WALK 4.44 (SD 2.45); WALK>=4 60.98%", "Distribution of counts (decks): pw_on: 0:2393, 1:1557, 2:203, 3:1; slow_on: 0:3867, 1:272, 2:14, 3:1; alw_on: 0:3142, 1:900, 2:105, 3:7; off: 0:4129, 1:22, 2:2, 3:1; tap_on: 0:1645, 1:1747, 2:650, 3:98, 4:11, 5:3", "\n## P4 / P5: per-card effect (pts) of land classes, all entered together (replaces a basic; land count controlled)", "  on-colour PW dual, Q(a) n=4154     all          -